WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You leave the room to get one thing.
By the time you arrive, the reason has disappeared.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers asked whether crossing a boundary
changes what is easy to remember.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Some tests found an effect.
A careful later study did not find it reliably.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Before you buy focus promises, try naming
one small action and giving it twelve minutes.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Zen12 sells short listening sessions in four styles.
That's its format—not proof of a benefit.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the research. Try the free fieldbook.
Decide what fits you.
